            "value": "O nível do microfone no Espelho e os controles de microfone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sirena brings together what you use every day on the Mac: windows, the Dock, ⌘ Tab, the clipboard, a shelf for files, the notch and quick controls in the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
